  "transcript": {
    "callId": "7782934452007",
    "transcript": [
      {
        "speakerId": "2001",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 15636,
            "text": "Hi, thanks for joining, good to see you."
          },
          {
            "start": 15637,
            "end": 62545,
            "text": "Hi there, appreciate you carving out a few minutes."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-08",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 78182,
            "end": 132909,
            "text": "Hi, thanks for having us, ready when you are."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2004",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 156364,
            "end": 234545,
            "text": "Glad to make time for this, let's walk through the list."
          },
          {
            "start": 234546,
            "end": 273636,
            "text": "Happy to go through whatever is on your list today."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-08",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 281455,
            "end": 304909,
            "text": "We are mostly in a good spot, just have a few things to run by you."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2001",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 328364,
            "end": 344000,
            "text": "Sounds good, let's get started."
          },
          {
            "start": 344001,
            "end": 367455,
            "text": "Happy to take these in whatever order makes sense to you."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-08",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 375273,
            "end": 453455,
            "text": "Our training team already has a library built for SCORM 2004, so whatever we move to needs to accept that packaging directly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-08",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 469091,
            "end": 492545,
            "text": "Our SCORM 2004 library runs close to 90 courses, built for our teacher certification renewal program."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2001",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 500364,
            "end": 516000,
            "text": "Appreciate that, let me confirm one thing before we continue."
          },
          {
            "start": 516001,
            "end": 562909,
            "text": "How many of those packages would you need to move over on day one versus migrate gradually?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-08",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 578545,
            "end": 641091,
            "text": "The 20 renewal courses would need to work right away, the older archive courses can come later."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2004",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 664545,
            "end": 688000,
            "text": "Appreciate the detail there, what else has been keeping you busy?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-08",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 711455,
            "end": 750545,
            "text": "We had a bit of flooding downtown after last week's storm."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2004",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 766182,
            "end": 781818,
            "text": "That is a lot of rain, hope it clears up before too long."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-08",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 805273,
            "end": 867818,
            "text": "One of our longtime staff members retired recently."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2001",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 891273,
            "end": 914727,
            "text": "That is a big shift, let us know if training support would help."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-08",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 922545,
            "end": 969455,
            "text": "The conference agenda for next month just came out."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2004",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 992909,
            "end": 1024182,
            "text": "Let us know if there is anything on our end for the badges."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-08",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1039818,
            "end": 1110182,
            "text": "We had our first snow of the season a few days ago."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2001",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1118000,
            "end": 1164909,
            "text": "Glad everyone stayed safe with the office closed for the ice."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-08",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1180545,
            "end": 1188364,
            "text": "A couple of part time staff moved into full time roles."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2004",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1204000,
            "end": 1258727,
            "text": "Hope the reorg settles in without too much disruption."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-08",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1274364,
            "end": 1321273,
            "text": "We are sharing a hotel block with a couple of other member organizations for the conference."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2004",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1336909,
            "end": 1399455,
            "text": "Thanks for the heads up, let us know if the agenda affects our schedule."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-08",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1407273,
            "end": 1422909,
            "text": "It has been raining here for what feels like a week straight."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2004",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1446364,
            "end": 1477636,
            "text": "Sounds like quite a stretch of weather, hope it settles down soon."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-08",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1485455,
            "end": 1493273,
            "text": "Our new hire starts full time next week."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2001",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1508909,
            "end": 1563636,
            "text": "That is a lot of change at once, hope it goes well."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-08",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1571455,
            "end": 1649636,
            "text": "We are coordinating carpools for a few of us heading to the conference."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2001",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1673091,
            "end": 1680909,
            "text": "Good to know, that sounds like an efficient way to handle the hotel."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-08",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1688727,
            "end": 1743455,
            "text": "It has cooled off quite a bit compared to last month."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2001",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1759091,
            "end": 1790364,
            "text": "Hope the weekend clears up for you."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-08",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1798182,
            "end": 1813818,
            "text": "We restructured a bit after a few departures this year."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2004",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1821636,
            "end": 1876364,
            "text": "Glad to hear reinforcements are coming for the team."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-08",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1892000,
            "end": 1899818,
            "text": "We are looking forward to catching up with a few peers at the conference next month."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2001",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1907636,
            "end": 1985818,
            "text": "Let us know if we can help with anything for the handouts."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-08",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 2001455,
            "end": 2079636,
            "text": "We are hoping for clearer skies for the weekend."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2001",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 2103091,
            "end": 2142182,
            "text": "Hope the storm did not cause too much trouble on your end."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-08",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 2157818,
            "end": 2212545,
            "text": "A few staff shifted departments after our reorg."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2001",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 2236000,
            "end": 2290727,
            "text": "Sounds like a lot of change, hope the transition goes smoothly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-08",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 2314182,
            "end": 2361091,
            "text": "Our team booked a booth at the conference happening next month."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2001",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 2384545,
            "end": 2415818,
            "text": "Good to know, safe travels once the flights are booked."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-08",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 2439273,
            "end": 2454909,
            "text": "Appreciate it, talk again soon."
          },
          {
            "start": 2454910,
            "end": 2478364,
            "text": "Appreciate the time, we will keep an eye out for the follow up."
          }
        ]
      },
